# Video masters. `public/hero.mp4` and `public/hero-mobile.mp4` are the encoded
# copies the site actually serves; these are the sources they were cut from, and
# nothing imports them (see media-src/README.md for the ffmpeg recipes). Keeping
# them out of the deployment upload saves ~9 MB per build.
media-src/

# Local tooling, never needed by the build.
.claude/
.impeccable/
